=== Information: ===
Tatsuya is an extremist who is willing to trust to make his city a better place.

He is torn between his feelings of betrayal and love for his family. He doesn't know how to deal with this dichotomy of emotions Anderson always agrees to get into trouble. Only after Shirou, his brother, and he must work together to solve a conspiracy does he realize that he is not alone in the world and that he has the power to improve his environment. He is the fastest free fire charectar.

